Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.68,0:01:22.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.78,0:02:25.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}God damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.39,0:02:37.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,醒醒  孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake it up, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.30,0:02:41.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么非得这么早\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why does it have to be so early?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.09,0:02:42.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天有很多事要做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got a lot to do today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.52,0:02:48.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想继续睡觉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to go back to sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.65,0:02:50.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.57,0:02:53.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚来找我的时候  \N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you wanted to be able to knock your brother
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.40,0:02:55.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说想打败你哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}on his butt when you first came to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.52,0:02:58.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真想这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That really what you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.85,0:03:02.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.33,0:03:04.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.26,0:03:07.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想跟你哥哥一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to be like your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.13,0:03:09.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.27,0:03:12.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.62,0:03:15.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.10,0:03:18.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,检查你的步法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check your feet,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.99,0:03:21.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-如果你的步法错  -一切都错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 'cause if your feet ain't right -- - Nothing's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.28,0:04:50.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们正打算出去清理...\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were just about to come out to clear the --
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.57,0:04:51.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,摩根在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Morgan?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.09,0:04:54.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你没事吧  -摩根在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You okay? - Where is Morgan?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.76,0:05:08.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么耶稣带达里尔和其他人来神之国\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did Jesus bring Daryl and everyone else to the Kingdom?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.67,0:05:12.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.69,0:05:19.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们想看看我们能不能一起合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}They wanted to see if we could all start working together on things.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.01,0:05:24.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救世军还在\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Saviors are still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.38,0:05:26.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们没跟神之国打仗  但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not fighting with the Kingdom, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.80,0:05:31.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,达里尔说他们在亚历山大打败了救世军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl said they beat them back in Alexandria.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.98,0:05:32.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.95,0:05:35.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们达成了协议吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That they made a deal with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.79,0:05:37.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is everyone okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.90,0:05:42.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我是不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tell me if it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.17,0:05:44.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得去问达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to talk to Daryl about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.65,0:05:53.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你让我不告诉所有人你的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanted me to keep the whole story about you from everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.58,0:05:57.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我不说你在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Told me not to say where you were,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.09,0:05:59.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我照你的吩咐做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I did what you asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.08,0:06:03.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,达里尔不是靠我找到你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl didn't find you because of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.81,0:06:06.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你俩之间说的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what was said between you and him
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.46,0:06:08.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你俩的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}was said between you and him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.07,0:06:14.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会跟你去亚历山大\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will go with you to Alexandria,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.83,0:06:16.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你想去\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you want to make the trip...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.05,0:06:19.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你想跟他谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you want to talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.21,0:06:27.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不该一个人去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shouldn't go alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.24,0:06:41.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你找到了想要的  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You found what you wanted, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.60,0:06:44.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你逃开了所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got away from everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.33,0:06:48.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是你想要的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it what you wanted?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.85,0:06:53.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是太迟  已经没法逃离了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was it just too late to get away?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.99,0:07:05.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在就能出发去亚历山大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, we can leave for Alexandria right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.57,0:07:08.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你想的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now, if you want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.99,0:07:17.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能帮你什么忙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there anything I can help you with?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.63,0:07:19.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不能  -我能不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - ‭Well, can I just --
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.38,0:07:22.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你不介意  我可以送你回小屋吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't mind, could I walk back to the cottage with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.64,0:07:23.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.02,0:07:26.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们今天要上贡  但我可以不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a drop today, but I can miss it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.11,0:07:29.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.26,0:07:32.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在努力学习\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to learn,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.28,0:07:34.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到了你之前做的事  我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}and seeing what you did here, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.64,0:07:37.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有五个行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were five of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.56,0:07:40.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你能让我看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would just really appreciate it
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.92,0:07:44.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是怎么做到的  我会很感激\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you would just...let me see how you do what you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.82,0:07:48.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行  去上贡吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Go do your drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.94,0:07:54.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.83,0:08:38.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(凯蒂)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.08,0:09:18.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,准你上前  娜比拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may approach, Nabila.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.77,0:09:20.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我待在这里挺好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine where I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.11,0:09:23.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希瓦喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shiva likes you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.81,0:09:27.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就害怕这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I'm afraid of.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.46,0:09:32.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我你找到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me what you found.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.30,0:09:34.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不会喜欢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.86,0:09:37.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我更不喜欢被坏消息吊胃口\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like waiting to hear bad news less.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.74,0:09:39.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们遇到了个小问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a little problem
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.54,0:09:42.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但它一周之内就可能变成个大问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}that could turn into a big problem inside of a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.52,0:09:45.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下面大部分植物都生了象鼻虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most of the plants down there, they got weevils.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.97,0:09:49.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须把它们全部剪了烧掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to cut and burn everything
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.04,0:09:52.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然会蔓延到院子里的主要农作物上\N{\fnArial\fs30}before the weevils get to the main crops in the courtyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.58,0:09:55.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道皇家花园对你而言很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know the Royal Garden is important to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.50,0:09:56.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.04,0:10:00.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你  娜比拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Nabila.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.55,0:10:02.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该怎么办就怎么办吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do what must be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.82,0:10:05.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,陛下  美妙之处就在于...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's the beautiful thing, Your Majesty --
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.33,0:10:09.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以把它们拔了剪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can tear it out and cut it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.83,0:10:12.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以把它们烧了扔掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can burn it and throw it all away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.85,0:10:16.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但如果您想的话  它们还会长回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you want, it can all grow back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.68,0:10:23.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我觉得我尿裤子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. I think I just pissed myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.72,0:10:26.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm-a gonna go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.92,0:10:48.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五分钟后出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're at "five minutes go."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.55,0:10:49.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.57,0:10:53.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你给了我这本书\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.23,0:10:56.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还在思考\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still thinking about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.19,0:10:59.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"伤害敌人就是伤害自己"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"To injure an opponent is to injure oneself."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.21,0:11:03.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无论如何都会受伤是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get injured no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.68,0:11:09.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我给你带了件礼物  放在你新家的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got something for you -- for the new place.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.30,0:11:12.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.79,0:11:24.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我出去找物资时在一家餐厅里发现的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found it at a restaurant I was scavenging.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.08,0:11:27.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我认识一个女孩  她帮我把它修好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know a girl, and she, uh, fixed it up for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.94,0:11:32.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}There.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.07,0:11:36.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我正看那钉子看烦了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was getting tired of looking at that nail.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.83,0:11:41.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个女孩是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, who's the girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.95,0:11:45.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还有三分钟就要出发了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're at, like, "three minutes go" right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.89,0:11:46.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以...\N{\fnArial\fs30}so...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.43,0:12:06.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那孩子小小年纪就得当爹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kid's too young to be a father.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.41,0:12:09.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你当过爹吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were you one?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.04,0:12:12.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当过  谢天谢地\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was, thank God.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.79,0:12:15.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我那时可不小\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I wasn't too young --
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.80,0:12:18.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完美的年纪  完美的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}perfect age, perfect time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.94,0:12:22.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有完美的家庭和完美的人生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had myself the perfect family and the perfect life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.77,0:12:27.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我所求不多  得到的却超出预期\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't ask for much, and I got more than I deserved.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.21,0:12:30.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.57,0:12:41.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉我俩之间有些不快\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry for how things have been between you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.16,0:12:45.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得你对杀戮的看法是错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you're wrong about killing...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.77,0:12:49.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,觉得我们能和救世军长期共处的想法也是错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}about how you think things can last like this with the Saviors.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.33,0:12:52.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我还是得道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.41,0:12:55.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你是个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're a good man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.37,0:13:04.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但总有一天  你不能再这样好下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}The day's coming where you can't be that good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.74,0:13:07.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等到那时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When that happens,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.96,0:13:10.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别为此自责\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't beat yourself up about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.59,0:13:19.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本杰明  我们该出发了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benjamin, it's time for us to take our leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.99,0:13:23.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见  小伙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you, little man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.65,0:13:26.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把馅饼放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave the cobbler.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.52,0:13:29.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真要这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.04,0:13:29.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰瑞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jerry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.11,0:13:33.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.66,0:13:43.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那女孩是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's the girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.50,0:14:00.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都别动  把枪端好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone stay down. Get your guns up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.54,0:14:03.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人把路堵上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody blocked the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.59,0:14:06.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定不是什么好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't be for anything good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.87,0:14:10.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,陛下  留在车里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty, stay inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.59,0:14:27.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你们想的话就下来看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a look if you want,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.65,0:14:29.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但把枪都端好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but keep your guns up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.00,0:14:43.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,梯队向右\N{\fnArial\fs30}Echelon right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.56,0:14:46.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,向那边那栋楼行进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Force towards the building over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.19,0:14:48.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(迪恩家电维修)
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.59,0:14:50.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家围着国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's close around the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.27,0:14:52.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来掩护\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.79,0:15:07.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们到那栋楼去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's move towards the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.06,0:15:15.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本杰明  把枪端起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benjamin, get your gun up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.59,0:15:20.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,端得够高了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think that's high enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.95,0:15:23.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你做得挺好的  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're fine, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.85,0:15:52.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(葬我于此)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.00,0:15:53.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.36,0:16:01.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个世界把人逼疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This world drives one mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.31,0:16:07.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人们经历了各种苦难\N{\fnArial\fs30}People have lived through every kind of misery...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.72,0:16:12.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,暴君  种族灭绝  仇恨制度\N{\fnArial\fs30}tyrants, genocide, systems of quiet hate...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.13,0:16:15.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而别人却在同一块土地上享受着自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}while others enjoy freedom on the same piece of land.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.24,0:16:18.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然而如今  我们唯有这样生存\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet this, how we must exist now...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.35,0:16:21.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没全被逼疯仅仅是走运\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is mere luck we are not all insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.14,0:16:25.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是走运  陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}It isn't luck, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.24,0:16:26.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.85,0:16:29.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这世界确实把人逼疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world does drive people crazy now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.26,0:16:31.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.39,0:16:34.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为我们创造了新世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}you made us another world.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.18,0:17:12.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们迟到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're late.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.08,0:17:14.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望你能原谅  我们在路上...\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you could indulge us your pardon, our path...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.11,0:17:15.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想听\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to hear about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.88,0:17:17.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别打断国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't interrupt the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.39,0:17:25.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你个獐头鼠目的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You rat-faced prick.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.38,0:17:29.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以西结  这里没有国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ezekiel, there aren't any kings,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.40,0:17:32.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总统或首相\N{\fnArial\fs30}presidents, or prime ministers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.53,0:17:35.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些都是童话故事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all that is a fairy tale, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.33,0:17:39.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别在我们面前玩"陛下"那一套\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't bring that "Your Highness" Shit our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.08,0:17:44.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很感谢你们一直上贡  但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I appreciate that you've been delivering, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.39,0:17:47.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,气氛总是不必要的紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}things have been unnecessarily tense,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.24,0:17:49.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我也不必要的紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that makes me unnecessarily tense.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.79,0:17:52.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来办这事不是找压力的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't go this route for stress.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.17,0:17:54.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我是来放松的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Just the opposite.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.30,0:17:58.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么进入正题  今天的贡品带了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let's get to it. Do you have today's offering?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.00,0:18:12.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们的枪我也要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want your guns, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.99,0:18:17.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,协议可没有这条\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did not agree to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.79,0:18:19.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们有个选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you got a choice...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.17,0:18:22.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我猜一开始你们就有这个选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same one that's been there since the beginning, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.31,0:18:24.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们可以交出枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can give up your guns,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.65,0:18:26.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者开枪试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}or you can try to use them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.80,0:18:29.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,选哪个\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's it gonna be?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.20,0:18:40.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们应该交枪  陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should give them over, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.45,0:18:43.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们应该交枪  陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Ehh, we should give 'em over, Your Majesty".
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.69,0:18:47.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者  也许我可以用棍子插穿你喉咙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or maybe I'll just shove this down your throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.66,0:18:51.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把棍子还给摩根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give Morgan his stick back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.02,0:18:55.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,枪就给你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you can have the guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.91,0:18:59.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-然后大家各奔东西  -以西结\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And all of us can go on with our day's journeys. - Ezekiel...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.67,0:19:05.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我需要你明白现在这种局面的严重性\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to understand the gravity of what's happening here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.83,0:19:08.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我给了你选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave you a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.65,0:19:11.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你选哪个\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it going to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.01,0:19:14.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,选吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.10,0:19:16.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道该选哪个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.61,0:19:17.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.26,0:19:31.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把枪给他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give them your guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.20,0:19:43.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们拿走你们的枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}We took your guns just now
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.13,0:19:45.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是因为你们马上会动感情\N{\fnArial\fs30}because things are about to get emotional.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.53,0:19:46.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,据以往的经验\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys have proven
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.58,0:19:49.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们一感情用事  就搞砸事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you don't do so good with emotional.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.54,0:19:50.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贡品不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're short.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.25,0:19:53.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要十二颗  这只有十一颗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We said 12. I count 11.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.93,0:19:55.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是十二颗\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are 12 there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.16,0:19:56.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不是  -再数一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There aren't. - Count again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.89,0:19:58.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来数\N{\fnArial\fs30}You count them!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.87,0:20:12.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我数过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I counted them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.47,0:20:15.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我数过  这不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did. T-This is impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.64,0:20:16.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.03,0:20:19.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's real.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.39,0:20:21.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就发生在眼前\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's happening now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.31,0:20:26.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而现在  问题必须解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the problems have to end...now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.98,0:20:30.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们必须明白代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to learn the stakes here,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.76,0:20:31.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得教教你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we're gonna teach you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.78,0:20:33.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们不用动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.30,0:20:36.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一小时之内我们会送来双倍贡品\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll get you twice the tribute in an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.37,0:20:38.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.89,0:20:41.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是唯一重要的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}is the only time that matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.93,0:20:43.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}And right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.82,0:20:48.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们没有履行义务\N{\fnArial\fs30}you haven't held up your side of the bargain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.42,0:20:52.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在我们谈了\N{\fnArial\fs30}After we have talked about things,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.33,0:20:56.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一遍又一遍之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}over and over again and again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.57,0:21:02.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们只能做个了结\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we're gonna deal with all of this...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.88,0:21:06.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.91,0:21:09.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在  是字面意思的"现在"吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now as in..."right now"?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.98,0:21:11.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.47,0:21:14.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right...now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.35,0:21:41.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,动手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.41,0:21:44.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.02,0:21:46.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.26,0:21:49.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.54,0:21:52.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody settle down!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.54,0:21:56.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得把本杰明带回神之国\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to get Benjamin back to the Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.06,0:22:01.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把那人的棍子还他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give the man his damn stick!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.22,0:22:04.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,滚回车里去  一个字都别说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in the truck! Don't say a goddamn word!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.45,0:22:09.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们得回去  - 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We need to get back.  - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.53,0:22:11.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在  你们都得听好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now, you have to listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.34,0:22:14.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这一次  给我听仔细了\N{\fnArial\fs30}For once, be present and listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.62,0:22:16.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以后  你们必须每一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will make your deliveries on time,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.84,0:22:19.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都按时送货  不能少一分\N{\fnArial\fs30}every time, and they will be complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.12,0:22:22.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要么优秀要么不及格  没有未完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's A's or F's, no I's.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.10,0:22:25.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明天把你们欠的贡品送过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are gonna show me that you understand
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.03,0:22:27.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,向我证明你们懂我的意思了\N{\fnArial\fs30}by bringing the balance of what you owe tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.28,0:22:29.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得马上走  他会流血身亡的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to go! He's bleeding out!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.19,0:22:31.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一颗甜瓜  不多不少\N{\fnArial\fs30}One cantaloupe, not more, not less!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.93,0:22:34.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明白了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.19,0:22:36.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.62,0:22:38.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-去处理他的伤口吧  -好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go patch him up. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.17,0:22:41.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戴安  我们得带他去卡萝尔那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dianne, we need to drive to Carol's!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.30,0:22:43.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们给了她很多医疗用品\N{\fnArial\fs30}We loaded her up with medical supplies!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.32,0:22:44.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得赶快止住他的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to stop the bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.43,0:22:46.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他撑不到回神之国了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not gonna make it to the Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.73,0:22:47.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.31,0:22:50.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.62,0:22:54.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上车啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.23,0:23:35.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坚持住  坚持住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay with me. Stay with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.36,0:23:37.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就在这呢  坚持住\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm right here. Stay with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.30,0:23:42.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-好了  没事  -没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right. Okay. - It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.44,0:23:45.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.31,0:23:51.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"伤害敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}"T-To injure an opponent...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.61,0:23:55.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是伤害自己"\N{\fnArial\fs30}is to injure yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.45,0:24:28.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉过来打扰你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry for coming to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.83,0:24:30.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们实在没办法了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.98,0:24:42.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,摩根  等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morgan, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.09,0:24:55.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.66,0:24:58.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.53,0:25:01.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(葬我于此)
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.71,0:25:04.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(清醒)
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.32,0:25:05.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别靠近我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.77,0:25:09.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.79,0:25:09.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.97,0:25:13.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(葬我于此)
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.41,0:25:13.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(听着就好)
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.29,0:25:18.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No! Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.44,0:25:20.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.96,0:25:25.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.59,0:25:27.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.05,0:25:32.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,够了  不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.25,0:25:51.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本杰明  把枪端起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benjamin, get your gun up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.68,0:26:18.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本来死的人该是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was supposed to be me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.36,0:26:22.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加文说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what Gavin said --
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.58,0:26:27.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会是第一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I'd be first.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.59,0:26:29.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我本想阻止的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was trying to stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.07,0:26:31.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我本想献出自己的性命来警醒你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was gonna give my life to show you!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.00,0:26:34.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天本该那样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what should've happened today.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.32,0:26:38.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是那样试着做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.83,0:26:40.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是发生了意料之外的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And something else happened
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.74,0:26:44.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我们没有做什么去阻止他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}because we have done nothing to stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.66,0:26:46.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们什么都没做\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've done nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.07,0:26:59.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.68,0:27:11.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,灾变发生时我在一个营地\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was in a camp when it started.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.88,0:27:18.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无边无际的大营\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was huge...endless...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.96,0:27:23.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到处是帐篷  茅厕\N{\fnArial\fs30}a city of -- of tarps and latrines
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.88,0:27:27.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,炊烟  婴儿的哭声\N{\fnArial\fs30}and wood smoke and babies crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.38,0:27:33.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总有婴儿的哭声\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were always babies crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.35,0:27:40.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道情况不妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew they had problems,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.96,0:27:43.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我不觉得轮得到我来管\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I didn't think they were mine to solve.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.50,0:27:48.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以为比我有能力比我聪明的人在管事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought there were stronger or smarter people there than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.08,0:27:53.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我算什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}W-Who the hell am I, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.37,0:27:59.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我什么都没做\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I did nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.75,0:28:06.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之后有一场战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A-And there was a fight...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.85,0:28:09.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,起了火\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.74,0:28:12.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我失去了妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I lost my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.66,0:28:18.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,三天没有食物  没有睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And after three days of running,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.15,0:28:21.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恐怖骇人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}no food, and no sleep...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.87,0:28:25.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,逃命后\N{\fnArial\fs30}of horror and terror...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.92,0:28:30.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我失去了女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost my little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.22,0:28:36.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在我面前...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right in front of me...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.63,0:28:48.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我什么都没做\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I didn't do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.83,0:28:53.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我干等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I waited.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.21,0:29:10.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.46,0:29:12.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.36,0:29:15.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.71,0:29:21.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以利用这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can use what's happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.32,0:29:25.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以向救世军表明我们吸取了教训\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can show the Saviors that we get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.66,0:29:29.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们明白要做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}We understand what we need to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.39,0:29:31.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们知道怎么继续下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know how to go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.63,0:29:37.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们要相信我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they need to believe us.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.51,0:29:42.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须得做点什么使他们相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to do something to make them believe us.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.74,0:29:48.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等我们赢回他们的信任后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then, when we gain their trust back...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.88,0:29:50.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再杀了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}we kill them...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.41,0:29:53.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一了百了\N{\fnArial\fs30}end them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.82,0:29:56.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们加入亚历山大和山顶寨的同盟\N{\fnArial\fs30}We join with Alexandria and the Hilltop,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.98,0:29:59.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一举歼灭他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we crush them in one fell swoop.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.40,0:30:07.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你得接受事实  摩根\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this is it, Morgan.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.64,0:30:15.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你必须要杀戮\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have...to...kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.24,0:30:22.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然你还不如自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or else you might as well just kill yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.66,0:30:31.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总得有人死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone had to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.05,0:30:34.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我曾想成为那个人  但没有成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried to be the one. That didn't happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.13,0:30:43.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我要成为领导我们的军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'll be the one to lead our army
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.90,0:30:47.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去粉碎救世军的人  摧毁他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}to crush the Saviors -- destroy them.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.10,0:30:50.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.94,0:30:55.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会和以西结说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll talk to Ezekiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.13,0:30:58.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会告诉所有人我做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell everyone what I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.99,0:31:04.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后我会用余生去弥补\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'll live the rest of my life making up for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.66,0:32:36.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你告诉他了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you tell him?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.88,0:32:41.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.51,0:32:43.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.51,0:32:47.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们回去再说\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll talk about it when we get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.43,0:32:48.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.67,0:32:51.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最好我们回去再说  陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's better to talk about it when we get back, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.94,0:32:56.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在就说\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll talk about it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.65,0:33:46.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那孩子怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's the kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.99,0:34:05.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.14,0:34:15.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在我杀了你之前快滚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Start walking back now before I kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.53,0:34:18.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你多说一句  多瞟一眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You say one word or throw one look,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.55,0:34:21.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就地杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll kill you right here and now.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.82,0:34:23.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,滚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.26,0:34:45.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,东西拿了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have it?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.30,0:35:04.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只想说  我们明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to say we get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.85,0:35:06.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.21,0:35:12.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-住手  -别管\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cease this! - Leave 'em be!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.35,0:35:15.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,摩根  住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morgan! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.88,0:35:16.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,摩根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morgan!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.28,0:36:09.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是他搞的鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}He set it all up.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.44,0:36:17.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他昨天挡路  让我们迟到\N{\fnArial\fs30}He blocked the road yesterday, made us late.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.37,0:36:21.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是他干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was all him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.05,0:36:27.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们离开时  贡品还在\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we had your offering when we left --
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.83,0:36:29.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全都在\N{\fnArial\fs30}had it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.78,0:36:38.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他从里面拿走了一颗  藏了起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He took one from the cargo, and he hid it --
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.87,0:36:40.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在我们停车时\N{\fnArial\fs30}when we stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.74,0:36:44.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他想挑起神之国和救世军的争端\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wanted to get something started between the Kingdom and the Saviors.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.82,0:37:02.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想让你看到...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wanted to show you...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.66,0:37:06.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想让你看到我们吸取了教训\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wanted to show you that we get it...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.06,0:37:11.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们明白需要做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}That we understand what it is that we need to do --
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.96,0:37:15.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们知道怎么继续下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}that we know how to go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.24,0:37:24.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.97,0:37:31.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下周  同一时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next week, same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.18,0:37:37.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}We -- We understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.42,0:38:02.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是他干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He -- He did this?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.51,0:38:05.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他之前就想为我们死\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wanted to die for us before.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.47,0:38:08.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他希望死的是自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wanted it to be him.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.52,0:38:17.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他以为自己有的选  所以德韦恩才死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought he could choose, and that's why Duane had to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.74,0:38:22.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"德韦恩"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Duane"?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.73,0:38:40.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本杰明  所以本杰明才...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benjamin -- Benjamin -- That's why Benjamin...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.86,0:38:46.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,摩根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morgan...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.70,0:38:50.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}let us take our leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.55,0:38:52.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我本来就打算走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was supposed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.15,0:38:55.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,摩根  你不能一个人待在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morgan, you should not be alone here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.40,0:38:56.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.26,0:38:58.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.99,0:39:01.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-本杰明不想...  -我说了现在不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Benjamin not -- would not - ‭Man, I said not now!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.47,0:39:06.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说了...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.76,0:39:16.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y'all just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.52,0:40:28.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(凯蒂)
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.25,0:41:24.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真想知道亚历山大发生了什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you really want to know what happened in Alexandria?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.74,0:41:29.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.94,0:41:33.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我杀了理查德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killed Richard.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.76,0:41:38.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,掐死了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I strangled him.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.20,0:41:43.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他害死了本杰明  所以...\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the one got Benjamin killed, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.43,0:41:50.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想知道亚历山大发生了什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want to know what happened in Alexandria?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.85,0:41:57.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.82,0:42:05.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尼根杀了格伦和亚伯拉罕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negan killed Glenn and Abraham.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.58,0:42:09.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.69,0:42:12.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用棒球棍活活打死了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beat them to death with a baseball bat.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.93,0:42:22.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在救世军统治亚历山大  瑞克和其他人...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now the Saviors have Alexandria, and Rick and everybody else...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.60,0:42:27.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都得为救世军做事\N{\fnArial\fs30}everything they do is for the Saviors now.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.66,0:42:39.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们还杀了更多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they killed more.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.28,0:42:47.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了斯宾塞  奥利维亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killed Spencer, Olivia...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.60,0:42:54.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,耶稣带瑞克一伙人来是因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus brought Rick and the rest here because...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.55,0:42:57.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克想反抗他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick wants to fight them.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.92,0:43:05.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你想知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanted to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.88,0:43:08.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在你知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.78,0:43:13.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你去哪  -我去杀他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are you going? - I'm gonna kill them --
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.88,0:43:15.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在外面  一个个杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}out there, one by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.93,0:43:17.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-但是去哪  -别的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But where? ? - Somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.96,0:43:18.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}W-Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.89,0:43:20.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Just wait. Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.48,0:43:30.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以走  同时也不走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can go...and not go.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.23,0:43:37.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.65,0:43:43.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.10,0:43:57.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(单行道)
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.30,0:44:45.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡萝尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carol.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.15,0:44:47.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.29,0:44:50.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.74,0:44:58.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会住在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna be here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.51,0:45:01.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要做准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.49,0:45:04.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须反抗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.47,0:45:09.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.13,0:45:13.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但不在今天\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not today.
